      ⍝ the entire ⎕AV, in ⎕AV order: in IBM APL2 this shows its real ⎕AV (to
      ⍝ check/correct GNU APL's table of it, Avec::IBM_quad_AV(), which
      ⍝ apl2_codec.py copies). In GNU APL it is GNU APL's own ⎕AV, so a
      ⍝ difference is expected. The display skips the 32 control characters
      ⍝ (they would break the lines of this file); the ⎕UCS numbers below
      ⍝ show all 256 positions.
